('Know your rights: a practical starting point','know-your-rights','Legal literacy','Understand how to find primary legal sources and seek qualified help.','Starter guide: identify the jurisdiction, find current primary sources, and consult qualified counsel for advice about an individual matter. Add and verify official citations before publication.','draft','Know your rights | YLR','A practical starting point for legal literacy.'),
('How to read a law before drawing conclusions','reading-a-law','Research methods','Check text, scope, commencement, rules and authoritative interpretation.','Starter guide: check the full text, commencement date, amendments, rules, jurisdiction and relevant binding interpretation. Add and verify primary citations before publication.','draft','How to read a law | YLR','A careful method for reading legislation and related sources.') on conflict(slug) do nothing;
